The issue is that reset_shown_hints clears the set, but if tests run concurrently, one test could reset while another is mid-check. But more importantly — `OnceLock is only for initialization; the Mutex<HashSet>` inside is properly shared. The reset_shown_hints() clears the set, so each test should call it first.

